# This repo only tracks the Hyprland/Quickshell ricing dotfiles - ignore
# everything else by default (the rest of ~/.config is app configs like
# Brave, Discord, RStudio, etc. that don't belong in a dotfiles repo).
*

!.gitignore

!hypr/
!hypr/**

!quickshell/
!quickshell/**

!awww/
!awww/**

!mpDris2/
!mpDris2/**

# WireGuard configs contain private keys - never commit these even though
# the directory itself would otherwise be allowed under hypr-adjacent paths.
wireguard-configs/
